- ExtElement -- unary negation
******************************

  * Operator: *note -: (Macaulay2Doc)-,
  * Usage: 
        u = - x
  * Inputs:
      * x, an instance of the type *note ExtElement: ExtElement,, $x$ is of
        type $E$, where $E$ is of type ExtAlgebra
  * Outputs:
      * u, an instance of the type *note ExtElement: ExtElement,, $u$ is of
        type $E$, the negation of $x$

Description
===========

The symbol - is used as notation for the Ext-algebra negation.

+------------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b,c}/{a b,b c}|
|                                    |
|o1 = L                              |
|                                    |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                     |
+------------------------------------+
|i2 : E = extAlgebra(3,L)            |
|                                    |
|o2 = E                              |
|                                    |
|o2 : ExtAlgebra                     |
+------------------------------------+
|i3 : -(2 ext_3-ext_4)               |
|                                    |
|o3 =  - 2ext_3 + ext_4              |
|                                    |
|o3 : E                              |
+------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note ExtAlgebra: ExtAlgebra, -- the class of all Ext-algebras

