differentialLieAlgebra -- make a differential Lie algebra
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L=differentialLieAlgebra(defs)
  * Inputs:
      * defs, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of Lie elements in a free Lie
        algebra
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 

Description
===========

The input should be a list of Lie elements in a free Lie algebra $F$ and this
list consists of the differentials of the generators, where $0_F$ is used for
the zero element. The option *note LastWeightHomological:
LastWeightHomological, for $F$ must have the value true.  The program adds
relations to the Lie algebra to get the square of the differential to be 0. Use
*note ideal(LieAlgebra): ideal_lpLieAlgebra_rp, to get these non-normalized
relations or *note describe(LieAlgebra): describe_lpLieAlgebra_rp, to just look
at them.











+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F1=lieAlgebra({a,b,c,r3,r4,r42},                             |
|        Weights => {{1,0},{1,0},{2,0},{3,1},{4,1},{4,2}},         |
|        Signs=>{0,0,0,1,1,0},LastWeightHomological=>true)         |
|                                                                  |
|o1 = F1                                                           |
|                                                                  |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D1=differentialLieAlgebra{0_F1,0_F1,0_F1,a c,a a c,r4 - a r3}|
|                                                                  |
|o2 = D1                                                           |
|                                                                  |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ideal D1                                                     |
|                                                                  |
|o3 = {(a a c) - (a a c)}                                          |
|                                                                  |
|o3 : List                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F2=lieAlgebra({a,b,c2,c3,c5},Signs=>{0,0,1,0,1},             |
|        Weights=>{{1,0},{1,0},{2,1},{3,2},{5,3}},                 |
|        LastWeightHomological=>true)                              |
|                                                                  |
|o4 = F2                                                           |
|                                                                  |
|o4 : LieAlgebra                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D2=differentialLieAlgebra{0_F2,0_F2,a b,a c2,a b c3}         |
|                                                                  |
|o5 = D2                                                           |
|                                                                  |
|o5 : LieAlgebra                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : describe D2                                                  |
|                                                                  |
|o6 = generators => {a, b, c2, c3, c5}                             |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}, {2, 1}, {3, 2}, {5, 3}}          |
|     Signs => {0, 0, 1, 0, 1}                                     |
|     ideal => { - (a b a), (a b a c2)}                            |
|     ambient => F2                                                |
|     diff => {0, 0,  - (b a), (a c2), (a b c3)}                   |
|     Field => QQ                                                  |
|     computedDegree => 0                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

