dims -- compute the dimensions of a Lie algebra, Ext-algebra or vector space
****************************************************************************

Description
===========

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        dm=dims(n,L)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the maximal degree
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * dm, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,,  the matrix of dimensions of
        $L$ in first degree $i$ and homological degree $j$, where $i$ ranges
        from $1$ to $n$ and $j$ from 0 to $n-1$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        dm=dims(n,E)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the maximal degree
      * E, an instance of the type *note ExtAlgebra: ExtAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * dm, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,,  the matrix of dimensions of
        $E$ in first degree $i$ and homological degree $j$, where $i$ ranges
        from $1$ to $n$ and $j$ from 0 to $n-1$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        dm=dims(n,V)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the maximal degree
      * V, an instance of the type *note VectorSpace: VectorSpace,, an instance
        of type  VectorSpace
  * Outputs:
      * dm, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,,  the matrix of dimensions of
        $V$ in first degree $i$ and homological degree $j$, where $i$ ranges
        from $1$ to $n$ and $j$ from 0 to $n-1$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        dl=dims(n,m,L)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the starting degree
      * m, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the ending degree
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * dl, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,,  the dimensions of $L$ in first
        degree $i$, where $i$ ranges from $n$ to $m$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        dl=dims(n,m,E)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the starting degree
      * m, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the ending degree
