ideal(LieAlgebra) -- get the relations in a Lie algebra
*******************************************************

  * Function: *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)ideal,
  * Usage: 
        x=ideal(L)
  * Inputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
  * Outputs:
      * x, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, $x$ may also be of type LieIdeal

Description
===========

The output is either the list of generators of the ideal or the ideal itself of
type LieIdeal.



+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : L=lieAlgebra{a,b}/{a a a b,b b b a}|
|                                        |
|o1 = L                                  |
|                                        |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : ideal L                            |
|                                        |
|o2 = { - (a a b a), (b b b a)}          |
|                                        |
|o2 : List                               |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : describe L                         |
|                                        |
|o3 = generators => {a, b}               |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}        |
|     Signs => {0, 0}                    |
|     ideal => { - (a a b a), (b b b a)} |
|     ambient => LieAlgebra{...10...}    |
|     diff => {}                         |
|     Field => QQ                        |
|     computedDegree => 0                |
+----------------------------------------+
|i4 : F=lieAlgebra{a,b}                  |
|                                        |
|o4 = F                                  |
|                                        |
|o4 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i5 : f=map(L,F)                         |
|                                        |
|o5 = f                                  |
|                                        |
|o5 : LieAlgebraMap                      |
+----------------------------------------+
|i6 : J=kernel f                         |
|                                        |
|o6 = J                                  |
|                                        |
|o6 : LieIdeal                           |
+----------------------------------------+
|i7 : N=F/J                              |
|                                        |
|o7 = N                                  |
|                                        |
|o7 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i8 : ideal N                            |
|                                        |
|o8 = J                                  |
|                                        |
|o8 : LieIdeal                           |
+----------------------------------------+

