image(LieAlgebraMap) -- make the image of a Lie algebra map
***********************************************************

  * Function: *note image: (Macaulay2Doc)image,
  * Usage: 
        I=image(f)
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * I, an instance of the type *note FGLieSubAlgebra: FGLieSubAlgebra,, the
        image of $f$, a finitely generated Lie subalgebra of the target of $f$

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F=lieAlgebra({a,b,c,r3,r4,r42},                                         |
|       Weights => {{1,0},{1,0},{2,0},{3,1},{4,1},{4,2}},Signs=>{0,0,0,1,1,0},|
|       LastWeightHomological=>true)                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = F                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D=differentialLieAlgebra{0_F,0_F,0_F,a c,a a c,r4 - a r3}               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = D                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I=lieIdeal{b c - a c,a b,b r4 - a r4}                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = I                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : FGLieIdeal                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Q=D/I                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : LieAlgebra                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : f=map(Q,D)                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = f                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : LieAlgebraMap                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : T=image(f)                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = T                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : FGLieSubAlgebra                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isSurjective f                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

