indexForm -- get a Lie element in the polynomial ring representation
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        r=indexForm(a)
  * Inputs:
      * a, an instance of the type *note LieElement: LieElement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * r, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the element in
        L#cache.mbRing corresponding to the input.

Description
===========

The ring L#cache.mbRing, see *note mbRing: mbRing,, is used to get an output of
Lie elements with indexed basis elements, which sometimes is better to use than
the iterated Lie products of generators, especially in high degrees. Use *note
indexForm: indexForm, to get the output in  L#cache.mbRing and *note
standardForm(RingElement,LieAlgebra):
standardForm_lpRingElement_cmLieAlgebra_rp, to get back the standard output.
The ring *note mbRing: mbRing, is very large: it has as many generators as the
total dimension of the computed Lie algebra. For this reason, you should give
the ring a name to avoid a large output. When $x$ is a linear polynomial in
L#cache.mbRing, the composition indexForm(standardForm(x) gives back $x$ . When
$x$ is a Lie element in $L$, the composition standardForm(indexForm x) is equal
to $x$ modulo the relations in $L$.



+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b,c}                                   |
|                                                             |
|o1 = L                                                       |
|                                                             |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                              |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : x = (basis(2,L))_0 (basis(3,L))_4                       |
|                                                             |
|o2 =  - (a c b b a) + (b a c b a) - (b c a b a) + (c b a b a)|
|                                                             |
|o2 : L                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R = L#cache.mbRing                                      |
|                                                             |
|o3 = R                                                       |
|                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : numgens R                                               |
|                                                             |
|o4 = 80                                                      |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : indexForm x                                             |
|                                                             |
|o5 = mb       - mb       - mb        + mb                    |
|       {5, 5}     {5, 7}     {5, 12}     {5, 15}             |
|                                                             |
|o5 : R                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : standardForm(oo,L)                                      |
|                                                             |
|o6 =  - (a c b b a) + (b a c b a) - (b c a b a) + (c b a b a)|
|                                                             |
|o6 : L                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : indexForm a a b c                                       |
|                                                             |
|o7 = - mb       + 2mb       - mb                             |
|         {4, 2}      {4, 5}     {4, 9}                       |
|                                                             |
|o7 : R                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : standardForm(oo,L)                                      |
|                                                             |
|o8 = 2 (a c b a) - (b a c a) - (c a b a)                     |
|                                                             |
|o8 : L                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : a a b c===oo                                            |
|                                                             |
|o9 = true                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

