isIsomorphism(LieAlgebraMap) -- whether a Lie map is an isomorphism
*******************************************************************

  * Function: *note isIsomorphism: (Macaulay2Doc)isIsomorphism,
  * Usage: 
        b=isIsomorphism(f)
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, source
        f == target f
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true if $f$ is an
        isomorphism, false otherwise

Description
===========

It is checked that $f$ is surjective and well defined (and commutes with the
differential). It follows from this that $f$ is also injective, since the
dimensions of source f and target f are equal in each degree.



+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L=holonomy{{a0,a1,a2},{a0,a3,a4},{a1,a3,a5},{a2,a4,a5}}|
|                                                            |
|o1 = L                                                      |
|                                                            |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f=map(L,L,{a5,a2,a4,a1,a3,a0})                         |
|warning: the map might not be well defined,                 |
|         use isWellDefined                                  |
|                                                            |
|o2 = f                                                      |
|                                                            |
|o2 : LieAlgebraMap                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isIsomorphism f                                        |
|                                                            |
|o3 = true                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : g=map(L,L,{a5,a0,a1,a2,a3,a4})                         |
|warning: the map might not be well defined,                 |
|         use isWellDefined                                  |
|                                                            |
|o4 = g                                                      |
|                                                            |
|o4 : LieAlgebraMap                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isIsomorphism g                                        |
|                                                            |
|o5 = false                                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------+

