    trace_lpZZ_cmLieSubSpace_cmLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- compute the trace of a Lie
    algebra map acting on a Lie subspace
  * *note isWellDefined(ZZ,LieAlgebraMap):
    isWellDefined_lpZZ_cmLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- whether a Lie map is well defined
  * *note Holonomy Lie algebras and symmetries: Holonomy Lie algebras and
    symmetries,

