LieAlgebra -- the class of all Lie algebras
*******************************************

Description
===========

This type represents graded Lie algebras. More precisely, the Lie algebras
under consideration are graded over ${\mathbb Z}^{+}\times {\mathbb Z}^n\times
{\mathbb Z}/2{\mathbb Z}$, where the first component is called the *note
degree: (Macaulay2Doc)degree,, and the last component is called the *note sign:
sign_lpLieElement_rp,, which is 0 or 1 and have effect on the axioms, see
below. The list of components of the grading except the sign is called the
*note weight: weight,, and the last component of the weight is called the
homological degree. If no differential is defined, then the homological degree
will be zero for all elements. Each object of type LieAlgebra is also a type L,
and elements in L belong also to the type *note LieElement: LieElement,, which
is the parent of L. Lie multiplication is given by *note LieElement LieElement:
LieElement LieElement,.

The axioms for Lie algebras depend on the signs of the generators, which are
specified by *note lieAlgebra(...,Signs=>...):
lieAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSigns=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,. The sign of a homogeneous
element can be obtained by the function *note sign(LieElement):
sign_lpLieElement_rp,. In the axioms below the sign of an element $a$ is
written sign($a$).



Anticommutativity: [$a$, $b$] =  -(-1)^{sign($a$) * sign($b$)} [$b$, $a$]

Jacobi identity: [$a$, [$b$, $c$]] = [[$a$, $b$], $c$] + (-1)^{sign($a$) *
sign($b$)} [$b$, [$a$, $c$]]

Also, in characteristic 2 and 3, there are in addition the following axioms:

Characteristic 2: [$a$, $a$] = 0

Characteristic 3: [$a$, [$a$, $a$]] = 0



+------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b}|
|                        |
|o1 = L                  |
|                        |
|o1 : LieAlgebra         |
+------------------------+
|i2 : a                  |
|                        |
|o2 = a                  |
|                        |
|o2 : L                  |
+------------------------+
|i3 : class L            |
|                        |
|o3 = LieAlgebra         |
|                        |
|o3 : Type               |
+------------------------+
|i4 : parent L           |
|                        |
|o4 = LieElement         |
|                        |
|o4 : Type               |
+------------------------+
|i5 : a b                |
|                        |
|o5 =  - (b a)           |
|                        |
|o5 : L                  |
+------------------------+
|i6 : weight oo          |
|                        |
|o6 = {2, 0}             |
|                        |
|o6 : List               |
+------------------------+

