LieAlgebra / LieAlgebraMap -- make a quotient Lie algebra
*********************************************************

  * Operator: *note /: (Macaulay2Doc)/,
  * Usage: 
        Q=L/f
  * Inputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
      * f, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, a map
        with target $L$
  * Outputs:
      * Q, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, the quotient
        of $L$ by the ideal generated by the image of the map $f$

Description
===========

This is the same as $L$ modulo the set of values of $f$ applied to the
generators of the source of $f$.

+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : M = lieAlgebra{a,b,c}              |
|                                        |
|o1 = M                                  |
|                                        |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : L = M/{a b}                        |
|                                        |
|o2 = L                                  |
|                                        |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : N = lieAlgebra({d}, Weights=>{2})  |
|                                        |
|o3 = N                                  |
|                                        |
|o3 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i4 : f = map(L,N,{a c})                 |
|                                        |
|o4 = f                                  |
|                                        |
|o4 : LieAlgebraMap                      |
+----------------------------------------+
|i5 : Q = L/f                            |
|                                        |
|o5 = Q                                  |
|                                        |
|o5 : LieAlgebra                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i6 : describe Q                         |
|                                        |
|o6 = generators => {a, b, c}            |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}, {1, 0}}|
|     Signs => {0, 0, 0}                 |
|     ideal => { - (b a),  - (c a)}      |
|     ambient => M                       |
|     diff => {}                         |
|     Field => QQ                        |
|     computedDegree => 0                |
+----------------------------------------+

