    quotient Lie algebra
  * *note LieAlgebra / List: LieAlgebra / List, -- make a quotient Lie algebra
  * *note differentialLieAlgebra: differentialLieAlgebra, -- make a
    differential Lie algebra
  * *note lieIdeal: lieIdeal, -- make a Lie ideal
  * *note kernel(LieAlgebraMap): kernel_lpLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- make the kernel
    of a map
