lieAlgebra(...,Signs=>...) -- optional argument for lieAlgebra
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L = lieAlgebra(gen,Signs => s)
  * Inputs:
      * gen, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the list of generators
      * s, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of signs (0 or 1), s has the same
        length as gen
      * s, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 0 or 1, the same sign is
        assigned to each generator
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 

Description
===========

This is an option to tell *note lieAlgebra: lieAlgebra, to assign the given
"signs" to the generators, which are either 0 (even) or 1 (odd). If the option
is given the value 1, then all generators will be odd. The default value is
that all generators are even. The signs affect the axioms of a Lie
superalgebra, see *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,. Use *note sign(LieElement):
sign_lpLieElement_rp, to compute the sign of an arbitrary homogeneous Lie
expression.



+--------------------------------------------+
|i1 : describe lieAlgebra{a,b}               |
|                                            |
|o1 = generators => {a, b}                   |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}            |
|     Signs => {0, 0}                        |
|     ideal => {}                            |
|     ambient => LieAlgebra{...10...}        |
|     diff => {}                             |
|     Field => QQ                            |
|     computedDegree => 0                    |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i2 : describe lieAlgebra({a,b},Signs=>{1,0})|
|                                            |
|o2 = generators => {a, b}                   |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}            |
|     Signs => {1, 0}                        |
|     ideal => {}                            |
|     ambient => LieAlgebra{...10...}        |
|     diff => {}                             |
|     Field => QQ                            |
|     computedDegree => 0                    |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i3 : describe lieAlgebra({a,b},Signs=>1)    |
|                                            |
|o3 = generators => {a, b}                   |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}            |
|     Signs => {1, 1}                        |
|     ideal => {}                            |
|     ambient => LieAlgebra{...10...}        |
|     diff => {}                             |
|     Field => QQ                            |
|     computedDegree => 0                    |
+--------------------------------------------+

