|     Field => QQ                                      |
|     computedDegree => 0                              |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : describe lieAlgebra{a,b}                         |
|                                                      |
|o3 = generators => {a, b}                             |
|     Weights => {{1, 0}, {1, 0}}                      |
|     Signs => {0, 0}                                  |
