LieAlgebraMap * LieDerivation -- composition of a homomorphism and a derivation
*******************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note *: (Macaulay2Doc)_st,
  * Usage: 
        h = g*d
  * Inputs:
      * g, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, a
        homomorphism from $L$ to $N$
      * d, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, a
        derivation from $M$ to $L$
  * Outputs:
      * h, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, a
        derivation from $M$ to $N$

Description
===========

The composition of maps $g*d$ is a derivation $M\ \to\ N$, with the composition
$g*f$ defining the module structure of $N$ over $M$, where $f: M\ \to\ L$
defines the module structure of $L$ over $M$.



+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b}           |
|                                   |
|o1 = L                             |
|                                   |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                    |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : d = lieDerivation{a a b,b b a}|
|                                   |
|o2 = d                             |
|                                   |
|o2 : LieDerivation                 |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : describe d                    |
|                                   |
|o3 = a =>  - (a b a)               |
|     b => (b b a)                  |
|     map => id_L                   |
|     sign => 0                     |
|     weight => {2, 0}              |
|     source => L                   |
|     target => L                   |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : N = lieAlgebra{a1,b1}         |
|                                   |
|o4 = N                             |
|                                   |
|o4 : LieAlgebra                    |
+-----------------------------------+
|i5 : g = map(N,L,{b1,a1})          |
|                                   |
|o5 = g                             |
|                                   |
|o5 : LieAlgebraMap                 |
+-----------------------------------+
|i6 : h = g*d                       |
|                                   |
|o6 = h                             |
|                                   |
|o6 : LieDerivation                 |
+-----------------------------------+
|i7 : describe h                    |
|                                   |
|o7 = a => (b1 b1 a1)               |
|     b =>  - (a1 b1 a1)            |
|     map => g                      |
|     sign => 0                     |
|     weight => {2, 0}              |
|     source => L                   |
|     target => N                   |
+-----------------------------------+

