LieDerivation LieDerivation -- Lie multiplication of ordinary derivations
*************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note SPACE: (Macaulay2Doc)SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        e = d1 d2
  * Inputs:
      * d1, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, 
      * d2, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * e, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, the Lie
        product of $d1$ and $d2$

Description
===========

The vector space $D$ of graded derivations from $L$ to $L$ with the identity
map as defining map, see *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, is a graded Lie
algebra. If $L$ has a differential $del$, then $D$ is a differential graded Lie
algebra with differential $d$\ \to\ [$del$,$d$].



+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b}/{a a a b,b b b a}                          |
|                                                                    |
|o1 = L                                                              |
|                                                                    |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : d0 = lieDerivation{a,b}                                        |
|                                                                    |
|o2 = d0                                                             |
|                                                                    |
