LieIdeal -- the class of all Lie ideals
***************************************

Description
===========

This type represents Lie ideals. It is a subtype of LieSubAlgebra and it has
FGLieIdeal as a subtype.





+-------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra{a,b}       |
|                               |
|o1 = L                         |
|                               |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                |
+-------------------------------+
|i2 : I=lieIdeal{a a b}         |
|                               |
|o2 = I                         |
|                               |
|o2 : FGLieIdeal                |
+-------------------------------+
|i3 : Q=L/I                     |
|                               |
|o3 = Q                         |
|                               |
|o3 : LieAlgebra                |
+-------------------------------+
|i4 : f=map(Q,L)                |
|                               |
|o4 = f                         |
|                               |
|o4 : LieAlgebraMap             |
+-------------------------------+
|i5 : J=kernel f                |
|                               |
|o5 = J                         |
|                               |
|o5 : LieIdeal                  |
+-------------------------------+
|i6 : I===J                     |
|                               |
|o6 = false                     |
+-------------------------------+
|i7 : describe I                |
|                               |
|o7 = generators => { - (a b a)}|
|     lieAlgebra => L           |
+-------------------------------+

The kernel of $f$ is defined as the inverse image under $f$ of the zero ideal.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : describe J                                   |
|                                                  |
|o8 = inverse => {f, finitely generated ideal of Q}|
|     lieAlgebra => L                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : J#inverse_1===zeroIdeal Q                    |
|                                                  |
|o9 = true                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+

