If both $A$ and $B$ are instances of LieIdeal, then $S$ is of type  LieIdeal.
If both $A$ and $B$ are instances of LieSubAlgebra but not both of LieIdeal,
then $S$ is of type  LieSubAlgebra. Otherwise, $S$ is of type  LieSubSpace.

