    model
  * *note map(LieDerivation): map_lpLieDerivation_rp, -- get the map in the
    definition of a Lie derivation
  * *note source(LieAlgebraMap): source_lpLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- get the source
    of a map
  * *note target(LieAlgebraMap): target_lpLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- get the target
    of a map
  * *note LieAlgebraMap LieElement: LieAlgebraMap LieElement, -- apply a Lie
    homomorphism
  * *note isWellDefined(ZZ,LieAlgebraMap):
    isWellDefined_lpZZ_cmLieAlgebraMap_rp, -- whether a Lie map is well defined
  * *note Homomorphisms and derivations: Homomorphisms and derivations,

