map(LieAlgebra,LieAlgebra,List) -- make a Lie algebra homomorphism
******************************************************************

  * Function: *note map: (Macaulay2Doc)map,
  * Usage: 
        f=map(L,M,homdefs)
  * Inputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
      * M, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
      * homdefs, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of elements in L
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Degree: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null,
      * *note DegreeLift: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
      * *note DegreeMap: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, a map
        from $M$ to $L$

Description
===========

The optional inputs given above are not relevant for Lie algebras. The
generators of M are mapped to the Lie elements in the last argument homdefs.
The output map f might not be well defined and not commute with the
differentials. It can be checked whether this is true by using *note
isWellDefined(ZZ,LieAlgebraMap): isWellDefined_lpZZ_cmLieAlgebraMap_rp,.



+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L1=lieAlgebra({a,b},Signs=>1,LastWeightHomological=>true,             |
|         Weights=>{{1,0},{2,1}})/{a a}                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o1 = L1                                                                    |
|                                                                           |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F2=lieAlgebra({a,b,c},                                                |
|         Weights=>{{1,0},{2,1},{5,2}},Signs=>1,LastWeightHomological=>true)|
|                                                                           |
|o2 = F2                                                                    |
|                                                                           |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : D2=differentialLieAlgebra{0_F2,a a,a a a b}                           |
|                                                                           |
|o3 = D2                                                                    |
|                                                                           |
|o3 : LieAlgebra                                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : L2=D2/{a a a a b,a b a b + a c}                                       |
|                                                                           |
|o4 = L2                                                                    |
|                                                                           |
|o4 : LieAlgebra                                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : use L1                                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f=map(L1,L2,{a,0_L1,a b b})                                           |
|warning: the map might not be well defined,                                |
|         use isWellDefined                                                 |
|                                                                           |
|o6 = f                                                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o6 : LieAlgebraMap                                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isWellDefined(6,f)                                                    |
|the map is well defined for all degrees                                    |
|the map commutes with the differential for all degrees                     |
|                                                                           |
|o7 = true                                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : describe f                                                            |
|                                                                           |
|o8 = a => a                                                                |
|     b => 0                                                                |
|     c => (a b b)                                                          |
|     source => L2                                                          |
|     target => L1                                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : use L2                                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : f c c                                                                |
|                                                                           |
|o10 = 2 (a b b a b b)                                                      |
|                                                                           |
|o10 : L1                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+

