map(LieDerivation) -- get the map in the definition of a Lie derivation
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note map: (Macaulay2Doc)map,
  * Usage: 
        f = map(d)
  * Inputs:
      * d, an instance of the type *note LieDerivation: LieDerivation,, 
