        default value null,
      * *note DegreeMap: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraMap: LieAlgebraMap,, 

Description
===========

The optional inputs given above are not relevant for Lie algebras. If $d$ is a
derivation $M \ \to\  L$, then there is defined a Lie algebra map $f: M \ \to\
L$, which determines the $M$-module-structure on $L$, and this map is
represented by map(d).

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L=lieAlgebra({x,y},Signs=>1)               |
|                                                |
|o1 = L                                          |
|                                                |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                                 |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M=lieAlgebra({a,b},Signs=>0,Weights=>{2,2})|
|                                                |
|o2 = M                                          |
|                                                |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                                 |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = map(L,M,{x x,x y})                     |
|                                                |
|o3 = f                                          |
|                                                |
|o3 : LieAlgebraMap                              |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : d = lieDerivation(f,{2 x,-y})              |
|                                                |
|o4 = d                                          |
|                                                |
|o4 : LieDerivation                              |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : describe d                                 |
|                                                |
|o5 = a => 2 x                                   |
|     b =>  - y                                  |
|     map => f                                   |
|     sign => 1                                  |
|     weight => {-1, 0}                          |
|     source => M                                |
|     target => L                                |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : d a b                                      |
|                                                |
|o6 = 0                                          |
|                                                |
|o6 : L                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+

