|                                       |
|o4 = (a b c) - 3 (c b a) + (1/3)(b a c)|
|                                       |
|o4 : L                                 |
+---------------------------------------+
|i5 : monomials y                       |
|                                       |
|o5 = {(a b c), (c b a), (b a c)}       |
|                                       |
|o5 : List                              |
+---------------------------------------+

