random(ZZ,LieAlgebra) -- get a random element of a Lie algebra
**************************************************************

  * Function: *note random: (Macaulay2Doc)random,

Description
===========

The optional inputs given above are not relevant for Lie algebras. Below is an
example of a periodic Lie algebra (a periodization of $sl_3$) with five
generators and seven random quadratic relations.

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        random(d,L)
  * Inputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note LieElement: LieElement,, a random Lie
        element of degree $d$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        random(m,L)
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the multi-degree
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note LieElement: LieElement,, a random Lie
        element of multi-degree $m$

Synopsis
========

  * Usage: 
        random(m,n,L)
  * Inputs:
      * m, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the homological degree
      * L, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note LieElement: LieElement,, a random Lie
        element of degree $m$ and homological degree $n$
+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L = lieAlgebra({a,b,c,d,e}, Field=>ZZ/7) |
|                                              |
|o1 = L                                        |
|                                              |
|o1 : LieAlgebra                               |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Q = L/apply(7,i->random(2,L))            |
|                                              |
|o2 = Q                                        |
|                                              |
|o2 : LieAlgebra                               |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : dims(1,8,Q)                              |
|                                              |
|o3 = {5, 3, 5, 3, 5, 3, 5, 3}                 |
|                                              |
|o3 : List                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : random({4,0},Q)                          |
|                                              |
|o4 = (-2)(d e e a) - (e e e a) + (-3)(e e e d)|
|                                              |
|o4 : Q                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+

