RingElement ExtElement -- multiplication of a field element and a Ext-algebra element
*************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note SPACE: (Macaulay2Doc)SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        y = a x
  * Inputs:
      * a, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, $a$ is an element
