The symbol SPACE is used as notation for multiplication by scalars. The scalars
belong to L#Field, which must be the same as M#Field, where \ $f: M\ \to\ L$.
If the field is not QQ, then the scalars are of type RingElement. If the field
is QQ, then the scalars are of type Number.

+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : F = toField(ZZ/7[x]/{x^2+1})  |
