The relations may have a non-zero linear part. Use *note
minimalPresentation(ZZ,LieAlgebra): minimalPresentation_lpZZ_cmLieAlgebra_rp,
to get a minimal presentation. Use *note describe(LieAlgebra):
describe_lpLieAlgebra_rp, to get information about the Lie algebra. This
contains the value of the three options *note lieAlgebra(...,Weights=>...):
lieAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmWeights=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,, *note
lieAlgebra(...,Signs=>...): lieAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSigns=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,,
