lieAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmField=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,, and also the values *note
generators(LieAlgebra): generators_lpLieAlgebra_rp,, *note ideal(LieAlgebra):
ideal_lpLieAlgebra_rp,, *note ambient(LieAlgebra): ambient_lpLieAlgebra_rp,,
*note diff(LieAlgebra): diff_lpLieAlgebra_rp, and *note
computedDegree(LieAlgebra): computedDegree,



