|                                                |
|o21 : LieAlgebra                                |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i22 : dims(1,4,L)                               |
|                                                |
|o22 = {2, 2, 1, 2}                              |
|                                                |
|o22 : List                                      |
+------------------------------------------------+
