Signs -- name for an optional argument for lieAlgebra
*****************************************************

Description
===========

This is an option to tell *note lieAlgebra: lieAlgebra, to assign the given
"signs" to the generators, which are either 0 (even) or 1 (odd).

See also
========

  * *note lieAlgebra: lieAlgebra, -- make a free Lie algebra
  * *note sign(LieElement): sign_lpLieElement_rp, -- get the sign of a
    homogeneous element
  * *note Second Lie algebra tutorial: Second Lie algebra tutorial,

Functions with optional argument named Signs:
=============================================

  * *note lieAlgebra(...,Signs=>...):
    lieAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSigns=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- optional argument for
    lieAlgebra

For the programmer
==================

The object *note Signs: Signs, is a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

